      "side": 1,
      "message": "Great catch, thank you! `CommentPorter` previously only set `skipFilesWithAllEditsDueToRebase(false)` (added before `skipRebaseFiltering` existed), which still let `ModifiedFilesLoader` filter out files untouched against `Parent 1`.\n\nUpdated `CommentPorter.loadCommitMappings` in PS3 to also pass `skipRebaseFiltering(true)`, and added `PortedCommentsIT#commentsOnMergeFilesUnchangedAgainstFirstParentArePortedAcrossRebase` covering both shifted line comments and deleted-file comments across a merge rebase.",
